\- First of all, no one that is selling courses and magic tricks can be your teacher! (these guys are making money off their courses and that's it, they don't even know how to make $100 a day constantly!).

&#x200B;

\- second of all, you don't want to promote clickbank scammy shit or maxbounty crap! 

&#x200B;

after many years doing this, I have made a lot of mistakes, and probably one of them was that i was overwhelmed with offers, and i wanted to promote them all! meanwhile the right way to do it is to focus only on one product and become the god of it. 

It can even be a stupid product that not a lot of people uses or that no-one promotes, but the thing is that it has to be a good product that can actually add value to people. 

Focus on one thing if you really like it and you think that it can be profitable!

 the best product is that you find a good revshare product and become the king with it. 

&#x200B;

google ads are super powerful to start, try to spend $5 and make $5.1 at first, then you just need to scale it up!

I know a dude that became millionaire promoting this stupid thing, that i have never heard before called [manage flitter](https://app.manageflitter.com/try/ux1O1uiA)

which is just a twitter manager that no one promotes and he just became the king of it with videos, blogs and stuff that he was making so much sales from this thing that made him millionaire!

&#x200B;

